WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.870
"This stinks!" Dipper said.

2
00:00:05.870 --> 00:00:10.391
"We're having a talent show.

3
00:00:10.392 --> 00:00:16.028
I need my music player!"

4
00:00:16.035 --> 00:00:19.932
"Let's check my junkyard," Gasser said.

5
00:00:19.932 --> 00:00:29.061
"Maybe we can find one there."

6
00:00:29.062 --> 00:00:43.962
The friends searched the junkyard.

7
00:00:43.962 --> 00:00:47.748
Gasser found a music player.

8
00:00:47.748 --> 00:00:50.399
"Thank you!" Dipper said.

9
00:00:50.399 --> 00:00:55.359
"I'll put it in later.

10
00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:58.170
Eddy, can you carry it?"

11
00:00:58.170 --> 00:01:02.659
Eddy nodded.

12
00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:05.359
Jeb lifted the music player.

13
00:01:05.359 --> 00:01:07.763
He put it in Eddy's dumper.

14
00:01:07.763 --> 00:01:11.276
Suddenly Jeb bumped a tire pile.

15
00:01:11.276 --> 00:01:14.502
One tire bounced onto Poppy.

16
00:01:14.502 --> 00:01:16.996
"Ouch!" Poppy said.

17
00:01:16.996 --> 00:01:20.336
Her hood got dented.

18
00:01:20.336 --> 00:01:33.162
"Sorry!" Jeb said.

19
00:01:33.162 --> 00:01:45.172
Gasser found Poppy a new hood.

20
00:01:45.172 --> 00:01:47.591
Jeb lifted the hood.

21
00:01:47.591 --> 00:01:50.155
He placed it in Eddy's dumper.

22
00:01:50.155 --> 00:01:52.295
Jeb looked at the hood.

23
00:01:52.295 --> 00:01:58.105
It balanced on the music player.

24
00:01:58.105 --> 00:02:07.689
Jeb told Eddy.

25
00:02:07.689 --> 00:02:10.693
Eddy grinned.

26
00:02:10.693 --> 00:02:16.532
"I have an idea, Jeb!" he said.

